flowchart TD
    A[User Login] --> B[Dashboard]
    B --> C{New Project?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Create Project]
    C -->|No| E[Select Existing Project]
    
    D --> F[Project Setup]
    E --> F
    
    F --> G[Define Challenge/Opportunity]
    G --> H[Configure Data Sources]
    H --> I[Select AI Personas]
    I --> J[Review Configuration]
    J --> K[Start Idea Session]
    
    K --> L[Data Retrieval Stage]
    L --> M[AI Processing Stage]
    M --> N[Seed Generation Stage]
    N --> O[Multi-Persona Collaboration]
    
    O --> P[Review Generated Seeds]
    P --> Q{Seeds Satisfactory?}
    Q -->|No| R[Provide Feedback]
    R --> O
    Q -->|Yes| S[Select Best Seeds]
    
    S --> T[Full Idea Development]
    T --> U[AI Expands Selected Seeds]
    U --> V[Idea Validation & Scoring]
    V --> W[Human Review & Refinement]
    
    W --> X{Ideas Ready?}
    X -->|No| Y[Iterate & Improve]
    Y --> U
    X -->|Yes| Z[Export & Implementation]
    
    Z --> AA[Generate Reports]
    AA --> BB[Create Presentations]
    BB --> CC[Implementation Planning]
    CC --> DD[Project Complete]
    
    %% Real-time feedback loops
    L -.->|Status Updates| FF[Real-time Dashboard]
    M -.->|Progress| FF
    N -.->|Live Generation| FF
    O -.->|Persona Chat| FF
    T -.->|Development Status| FF
    
    %% Data flow
    H --> EE[External APIs]
    EE --> GG[Market Research]
    EE --> HH[Competitor Analysis]
    EE --> II[Social Media]
    EE --> JJ[Industry Reports]
    
    %% Persona types
    I --> KK[The Visionary]
    I --> LL[The Analyst] 
    I --> MM[The Critic]
    I --> NN[The Customer Advocate]
    I --> OO[Custom Personas]
    
    %% Export options
    Z --> PP[PDF Reports]
    Z --> QQ[PowerPoint Slides]
    Z --> RR[Implementation Roadmap]
    Z --> SS[API Integration] 